{
  "id": "832",
  "title": "Don't Drink Hot Water",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-11-14",
  "synopsis": "Do you enjoy drinking hot water?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/832/c6cd4e9c0e0f18813d641eeedb95857b01f93f81.mp3?1573478577",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "不喝热水\n\n小何：美国好玩吗？\n小张：好玩。就是有一点不好——饭店里没有热水。\n小何：美国人不喝热水。\n小张：是啊。有一次，我很想喝热水。后来，我对服务员说‘请给我一杯咖啡，里面不要咖啡，不要奶’。",
    "traditional": "不喝熱水\n\n小何：美國好玩嗎？\n小張：好玩。就是有一點不好——飯店裡沒有熱水。\n小何：美國人不喝熱水。\n小張：是啊。有一次，我很想喝熱水。後來，我對服務員說‘請給我一杯咖啡，裡面不要咖啡，不要奶’。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don’t Drink Hot Water"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：美国好玩吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：美國好玩嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé měi guó hǎo wán ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Was it fun in America?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：好玩。就是有一点不好——饭店里没有热水。",
      "traditional": "小張：好玩。就是有一點不好——飯店裡沒有熱水。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo wán jiù shì yǒu yì diǎn bù hǎo fàn diàn lǐ méi yǒu rè shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes. It’s just one thing that wasn’t good – there’s no hot water in restaurants."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：美国人不喝热水。",
      "traditional": "小何：美國人不喝熱水。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé měi guó rén bù hē rè shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Americans don’t drink hot water."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：是啊。有一次，我很想喝热水。",
      "traditional": "小張：是啊。有一次，我很想喝熱水。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì a yǒu yí cì wǒ hěn xiǎng hē rè shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "后来，我对服务员说‘请给我一杯咖啡，里面不要咖啡，不要奶’。",
      "traditional": "後來，我對服務員說‘請給我一杯咖啡，裡面不要咖啡，不要奶’。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái wǒ duì fú wù yuán shuō qǐng gěi wǒ yì bēi kā fēi lǐ miàn bú yào kā fēi bú yào nǎi",
      "english": "Little Zhang: So it is. There was one time, that I really wanted to drink hot water."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Later, I said to the waiter ‘Please give me a cup of coffee, and I don't want coffee or milk in it’."
    }
  ],
